<title>UK: EIB adds 500 million French franc to Tec-10 bond.</title>
<headline>EIB adds 500 million French franc to Tec-10 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Societe Generale, has been increased from 1.0 billion French francs to 1.5 billion French francs.  BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.5 BLN FFR   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    06.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE   TEC-10 LINKED ISS PRICE  101.675   PAY DATE    06.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES   ** 7.5 PCT CAP AND 4.5 PCT FLOOR ON COUPON</p>
<p>		COUPON WILL BE TEC-10 MINUS 1.42 PCT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/PAR   PAY FREQ    QUARTERLY</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-100-1M SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    FRENCH    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  1.675     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
